{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956370/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1756721048\" width=700 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956370/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1756721048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956370/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1756721048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET ULA!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beautiful Undina has left her cool, crystalline waters to join the Celestas' Moon Festival. For this special occasion, she's swapped her usual armor for the finest silk kimono, its gentle waves caressing her soft skin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proud and graceful, Ula knows her worth. She's determined to be the festival's star dancer, capturing every heart in the crowd\u2014but she's hunting yours most of all. Before you know it, she'll draw you into her tea ceremony, seduce you with a sensual dance, and finally lead you into her private chambers. In the bedroom, she's a master enchantress with dark desires, fully versed in the art of pleasure, ensuring you won't crave anyone else afterward...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956370/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1756721048\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Ula as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also receive 10,000 Gold, 100 Rubies and 10 Common Mystic Tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most importantly\u2014you'll have our heartfelt thanks. Thank you for choosing to support this DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956370/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1756721048\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956370?t=1756721048","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956370?t=1756721048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956370/72f4d90b5bcc594bfe7b5f66e3740ee0cd4e21b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756721048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956370/72f4d90b5bcc594bfe7b5f66e3740ee0cd4e21b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756721048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters in the game are over 20 years old. This DLC contains explicit adult themes, including nudity and sexual acts. Please be aware and ensure that you are in an appropriate location before playing to avoid causing distress to others."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956370/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1756721048\" width=700 height=10